WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,220
After returning to base, I will truthfully report this encounter.

2
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:08,220
Are you sure?

3
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:10,220
Planning can only verify what you said

4
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:12,220
We can just say part of it

5
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:13,220
continue to hide

6
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:15,220
The base will only send other teams in

7
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:17,420
The next time you meet someone from Mokawa

8
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:19,420
He may not make it out alive like us.

9
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:20,420
What are you going to say?

10
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:24,580
He can communicate, and he does not hunt down anyone who is not actively attacking.

11
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:25,580
It is precisely to strike first and then die.

12
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,580
The leader has a planner

13
00:00:27,580 --> 00:00:29,990
These facts cannot be hidden

14
00:00:29,990 --> 00:00:30,990
As for what to choose next?

15
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:41,220
A leader is sure

16
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:43,220
Leading the flag can avoid ordinary physical attacks

17
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:45,700
Now the power is in my hands

18
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:47,700
should be more useful
